{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日ウォークマンをおまかせチャンネルにしてシャッフルで曲聴いてたんだ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐるぐるカーテンが流れてきて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかほっこりとしたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初心忘れるべからず。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大事だねこういう気持ち"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/11/05/1567534/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/11/05/1567534/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今夜アメトーーク!に出演しますっヽ(・∀・)ノヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張しましたっヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ですが、生駒ちゃんまたひとつ野球について学ぶことが出来ましたヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ見てくださいねっヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大事な事だから二回言います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひみてくださいねっヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バラエティ番組に沢山出るぞ〜ヽ(・∀・)ノヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"使える人間に俺はなるっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アメトーーク!の収録日にテレビ朝日さんの楽屋でドSな可愛い女の子に捕まってしまったの〜(⁼̴̀ૢ꒳​⁼̴́ૢ๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/11/05/1567534/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハナエちゃーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/11/05/1567534/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/11/05/1567534/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/11/05/1567534/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragr